## 3. TIER-1 TECHNICAL SCHEMATIC
### 3.1 Osmotic Pressure Calculus (van 't Hoff Equation)
Ebony calculates the required high-pressure pump PSI by determining the osmotic pressure ($\Pi$) of the seawater based on the van 't Hoff index ($i$), molar concentration ($M$), ideal gas constant ($R$), and temperature ($T$):

$$\Pi = i \cdot M \cdot R \cdot T$$

